    "summary": "Astra single-pass personal visual reading of the full matched source pack. Preserve all seven independent original problems and IDs. Recover six official keys and scoring; distinguish suggested KOR correction documents from final day/night keys without silently adopting either discrepancy. No separate checker. Day and night instructions are scoped to their own problems. All original question diagrams retained. All 20 prepared pages personally read. The three KOR DOCX members retain real ZIP/member provenance. Original uncorrected ZIP DOCX keys were text-compared to the final PDFs, not separately claimed as visually read. The separately archived team question supplies no key. All nine final no-snap crops personally viewed after upload, including full answer chart and every question photograph. ZIP helper exported all five correction pages; personally compared those against the scratch exports before freeze.",
    "sourceGaps": [
      "No official solution or measured height for the Mountain team task is supplied in the inspected 2018 archive inventory; the separate team PDF repeats its question."
    ],
